  <item>
    <title>009｜从户外到复古，与TeddyMag聊聊各个消费圈层的标签化</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6524272319dde7bf6a38559c</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6524272319dde7bf6a38559c</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 09 Oct 2023 16:15:29 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="38">00:38</a> 与潮流文化生活媒体TeddyMag的二位主理人聊聊标签化的怪现象</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="330">05:30</a> 在追求个人风格的今天，统一制服的哈雷大哥为何如此骄傲</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="423">07:03</a> 曾经藤原浩的话就是时尚圣经，现在每个人都是多元个体</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="625">10:25</a> “味儿”不够正的田凯，穿Guidi打破刻板风格谁也不取悦</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1120">18:40</a> 论坛时代与自媒体的区别：深度的吵架一去不返</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1340">22:20</a>态度与眼红是两码事，商业成功面临的骂街是怎样的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1560">26:00</a> 是谁在歧视无法征服大自然的Kiko Kostadinov x Camper？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1810">30:10</a> 中国男性消费的是阶级，文化包容与消费动机矛盾</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2100">35:00</a>从晖子买的最后一双球鞋Mihara x Nigel Cabourn开始聊聊皮鞋</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2280">38:00</a> 九十年代皮鞋名录：H.O.T的CAT和皮鞋配白袜的精神小伙</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2720">45:20</a> 环形鄙视链，看太不懂就是开始变老的预兆</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2980">49:40</a> 穿Matina的嬉皮晖子，挑战绅装圈老玩家的敏感点</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3240">54:00</a> 选择鄙视的人永远在鄙视，拥抱多样化，谁土谁知道</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lncEHO9OE5LTXMR-2McympWypaST.m4a" length="109649695" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:56:48</itunes:duration>
