  <item>
    <title>008｜从追随设计到自己创造，不同年代玩鞋男孩的成长轨迹</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/64fff3e5e490c5dee500eebc</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">64fff3e5e490c5dee500eebc</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 12 Sep 2023 05:15:16 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>-简介-</span></p><p><span>由Radiance Blue的魏老板主持的视频播客节目开播，抛开目的性的卖衣服，这次从鞋履的收藏作为切入点，每期每位嘉宾带来3双自己的挚爱收藏，在一个有点味道的桌子上聊聊消费、聊聊文化、可能还有商业内幕和怪癖。</span></p><p><span>-本期成员-</span></p><p><span>Hsin：Radiance Blue老板，小红书@Radiance Blue的魏老板，本期85后代表</span></p><p><span>Tao：RB采购部门负责人，本期90后代表</span></p><p><span>Price：万能设计师，Raf Simon爱好者，本期95后代表</span></p><p><span>-本期登场鞋靴-</span></p><p><span>Price: Adidas YEEZY 750, Adidas EQT adv17 support, Adidas Raf Simons Ozweego</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lm6RX-nN3fryxRdP90HQ3C4CZ_-I.jpg"></figure><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/luKUFM30QZD4gVmUH0kIV4HTP2yC.jpg"></figure><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lungzffmX_aql4XKu2eIp23QLQuN.jpg"></figure><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lpjsbVhcfw-8yW_UwxEItrWvoCkK.jpg"></figure><p><span>Tao哥: Air Jordan 11 Space Jam 09, Salehe Bembury * Clarks Originals, FEIT Lugged Chelsea</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lvQIqvEpLc3ekTnhvmJ4cDarvuHg.jpg"></figure><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lmcBzWW4eBvLJ2vMngAqK4j1F_sA.jpg"></figure><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lt_jMYyZpKu9PgDVTKx37TdolIiI.jpg"></figure><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lus12RXqoJyVWiK_3Xgb3ot71cQz.jpg"></figure><p><span>-时间轴-</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="168">02:48</a> 和完全不受阿美咔叽“污染”的团队成员，聊聊不同年代对玩鞋的感受</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="330">05:30</a> Yeezy 750，设计师运动鞋的启蒙意义</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="784">13:04</a> 深受Justin Bieber影响：属于高帮球鞋的少年时代</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1180">19:40</a> Adidas统治的年代：球鞋引进设计师合作的黄金年代</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1404">23:24</a> 球鞋男孩细说阿迪达斯三条杠的历史演变</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1673">27:53</a> Balenciaga triple-x对时尚风格和廓形的影响</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1840">30:40</a> 10平米的房间50多双鞋，球鞋脑袋闻着鞋味入睡</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2472">41:12</a> 最最最喜爱的Air Jordan 11代，从2009年至今不变的经典</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2780">46:20</a> Clarks Salehe Bembury，极简莫卡辛皮鞋结构的体现</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3083">51:23</a> 嘻哈Style代表Tao，从小学就开始听hip hop的京城男孩</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3350">55:50</a> 意外养牛的Price，养到破洞就当破裤子扔掉了</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3640">60:40</a> 理性消费：买不起的东西不要急，喜欢过更重要</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3800">63:20</a> 见证一双鞋诞生的不断试验，从纸上到脚上犹如梦想成真</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/ljLxoxxZBeQIAQRxwTDDBMhwBN-K.m4a" length="138806038" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:11:54</itunes:duration>
