    <itunes:episode>8</itunes:episode>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>007｜从球场上的“运动仔”到走红毯的时尚icon，和孙阳聊聊消费成长史</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/64fa99906884ccbb1959f5a1</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">64fa99906884ccbb1959f5a1</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 08 Sep 2023 03:48:30 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>-本期成员-</span></p><span></span><p><span>孙阳：演员，代表作《过春天》《孤注一掷》《第八个嫌疑人》。小红书@孙阳_Sunnysun</span></p><span></span><p><span>Hsin：Radiance Blue老板，小红书@Radiance Blue的魏老板</span></p><span></span><p><span>Noah llc：前媒体人，2nd Floor Cinema老板，小红书@SECOND FLOOR CINEMA</span></p><span></span><p><span>Ron：2nd Floor Cinema老板，小红书@Ron</span></p><span></span><p><span>-时间轴-</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="40">00:40</a> 开篇-荧幕新晋帅痞恶人，演员孙阳来做客鞋说</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="260">04:20</a> 对走红的fancy生活没感觉，与大家分享更重要</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="380">06:20</a> 作为半运动员的童年，每周末在九龙又一城种下对球鞋的热爱</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="492">08:12</a> 被科比带货的魏老板，中学篮球场上的球鞋少年</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="734">12:14</a>魏老板混戏剧社，与Papi酱不得不说的往事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="950">15:50</a> Noah被女班长安利听视觉系摇滚，开启暗黑系的青春期</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="995">16:35</a> 穿球鞋的“运动仔”在粤语竟然可以用来骂人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1038">17:18</a> 白鞋Collection：孙阳的中学时期在和同学拼什么</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1159">19:19</a> 台湾男仔Ron被阿迪达斯贝壳头统治的青少年时期</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1360">22:40</a> 穿球鞋的孙阳，从未被阿美咔叽污染过的时尚ICON</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1790">29:50</a> 从原宿系潮男到穿黑色Converse的文艺青年</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2150">35:50</a> 咔叽实用主义：发现牛仔裤可以养，鞋可以换底</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2300">38:20</a> 复制别人的穿着，并不能让自己穿得更好看</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2550">42:30</a> 从溶解鞋到老爹鞋，Trunky大鞋的趋势是否已经过气？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2770">46:10</a> 下一个趋势是什么？四人组分享心目中的next buy</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2985">49:45</a> 全员猛男粉，不想买Nike的孙阳接下来会买什么？</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/liFXI48AgHvtBzNYzdhx4Lf7_mmp.m4a" length="103780230" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:53:45</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZS54eXpjZG4ubmV0L0ZwZ3RkZndCZ3A0VDVtTmdNUVNNYlBLNnlPWnkucG5n.png"/>
    <itunes:episode>7</itunes:episode>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>006｜带着偶像包袱聊偶像，新生代设计师和买手怎么买鞋</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/64bfcd78b3f6c440a806ce68</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">64bfcd78b3f6c440a806ce68</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 25 Jul 2023 13:26:15 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>-本期成员-</span></p><span></span><p><span>Hsin：Radiance Blue老板，小红书@Radiance Blue的魏老板</span></p><span></span><p><span>阿勒：Radiance Blue万能工具人，小红书@尼梅勒斯</span></p><span></span><p><span>宽宽：MotivMfg品牌助理设计师，小红书@中森宽子</span></p><span></span><p><span>-时间线-</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="201">03:21</a> 互相拆台的97年新生代设计师和服装买手</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="324">05:24</a> 先锋与咔叽的碰撞，新生代鞋靴玩家的怪味收藏</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="438">07:18</a> 在巴黎学设计的版师是如何败家的？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="813">13:33</a> 从咔叽开始转向暗黑工匠系审美的朋克造型师</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="968">16:08</a> 作为Nemeth野生代言人的尼梅勒斯</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1027">17:07</a> 英伦小众HOBAC短暂但划时代的设计</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1347">22:27</a> 被中国代购攻陷的Nemeth专卖店</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1486">24:46</a> 小众皮革艺术家品牌Moto的鞋履作品</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1650">27:30</a> RB经营十年背后的商业机密首次揭露</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1739">28:59</a> 真正的皮鞋玩家只用马臀皮皮鞋挂档</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1964">32:44</a> 比较会穿的男生蹦迪穿什么鞋？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2192">36:32</a> 从一手到四手：Archive单品是如何被运作的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2490">41:30</a> 先锋工匠Dimissianos的设计巧思</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2901">48:21</a> 被低估的Nike，隐藏的Considered Line小众款介绍</span><br><span></span><br><span>-本期登场鞋靴-</span></p><span></span><p></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/ltpt0tko8uVOEetkjOuWk3ZmxLVW.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>寬寬：Alden P楦 3917、MOTO Chukka、Dimissianos Whole Golosh Oxford</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/llGXFWj7Mj9C8XRwREw-gLSoum3C.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/luOE80f9mrNopnwzQxAiTFqxdQSU.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lrIXL1wL0jlnLrD5el9VY51MN2lb.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>阿勒：John Moore、Undercover AW04、NIKE considered</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/loG9RZHcr_5HUOMkluDEz5ITKb7C.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lpFX0AKSaG47TiMY1OOuwH1XvWx1.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lquvqZ4Y1TZ1puj7tlCRhV-yZNVf.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lvzJL3R-XKSNbAug2h56Gj1FrM5u.m4a" length="107000028" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:55:25</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZS54eXpjZG4ubmV0L0ZnYl85bFVxMVpzQ2tyUTdFNEtLQjE5WW1FbVcucG5n.png"/>
