    <guid isPermaLink="false">647f3d5253a5e5ea1409342b</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 06 Jun 2023 14:06:09 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>-简介-</span></p><span></span><p><span>由Radiance Blue的魏老板主持的视频播客节目开播，抛开目的性的卖衣服，这次从鞋履的收藏作为切入点，每期每位嘉宾带来3双自己的挚爱收藏，在一个有点味道的桌子上聊聊消费、聊聊文化、可能还有商业内幕和怪癖。</span></p><span></span><p><span>-本期成员-</span></p><span></span><p><span>Hsin：Radiance Blue老板，小红书@Radiance Blue的魏老板</span></p><span></span><p><span>Noah llc：前媒体人，2nd Floor Cinema老板，小红书@SECOND FLOOR CINEMA</span></p><span></span><p><span>Ron：2nd Floor Cinema老板，小红书@Ron</span></p><span></span><p><span>-本期登场鞋靴-</span></p><span></span><p><span>Ron：Carpe Diem早期款Derby、后拉链、侧拉链</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fgo7NkrL95FHlpSnvzn7czedI5dz.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmhdyEM_DIcz4qYhDKpydt0CrwjK.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fk0xrKEHVWAnGxLrvfdgSRsuJDQW.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>Noah：Toga、Clarks X LVC、YSTRDY'S TMRRW</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhN1YAxn00ITxo99dkLyvYWT9cnY.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtZZO3XwxxMaz8DcwyD8c6myWpS2.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrlDFkpe0-wQZfPfubsfYNdy73Uv.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FokiK1XDEf2voOFuXs1uL_fSqc1S.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>-时间线-</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="225">3:45</a> 鞋说开播，魏老板不卖货，聊天聊内幕</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="364">6:04</a> 媒体人Noah LLC聊Cult和小众癖</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="615">10:15</a> 2FC主理人Ron聊聊意大利工匠鞋典品牌Carpe Diem</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="825">13:45</a> 胖人穿胖鞋，瘦人穿瘦鞋，打工人穿打工鞋</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1020">17:00</a> 皮鞋和皮鞋到底有什么区别，侧拉和后拉哪个显瘦？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1160">19:20</a> Noah聊聊非传统品牌Toga，不想因为穿鞋被定义</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1290">21:30</a> 男人的衣柜都差不多，喜欢一件就重复买？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1475">24:35</a> 造型师根本不管鞋子舒适度，最重要是好搭</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1595">26:35</a> 粉色Shoe Cult鞋子收藏大曝光，穿鞋就是越脏越帅</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1980">33:00</a>两岸三地中学男生穿鞋比较，谁先实现穿鞋自由</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2200">36:40</a> Converse买买买停不下来，硫化鞋怎么搭都不会错</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2505">41:45</a> 小众配色设计令人上头，最后难逃打折命运？</span></p>]]></description>
